The Falcon Marshal is the neutral elite of the Skyscout (Gryphon Rider
route; no alignment asked). A foe its Dive lands on is marked for two
rounds: every ally strikes it harder.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Marshal's mark     a foe a Dive lands on is marked for 2 rounds: every
                        ally has +5 Attack against it
  35 Keen horizon       Eagle eye gives +18 Perception
  40 Falcon's talons    +4 Attack
  45 Rallying cry       the mark gives +8 Attack
  50 Swift wings        a Dive deals 50% more damage
  55 Marshal's guard    +6 Evasion
  60 Sky commander      the mark gives +12 Attack

It needs the Skyscout first (<ansi fg="command">help gryphon-rider-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30 a
character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] falcon-marshal confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Gryphon Rider talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Iron Hide (+5 Armor),
Veteran's Edge (+3 Attack), Shadow Footing (+5 Evasion). See <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help gryphon-rider-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help gryphon-rider</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
